  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　調味料。しかし　色々な食材と　マッチする。ただし　カロリーには　注意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛이 강한 조미료. 그러나 다양한 식재료와 잘 어울린다. 대신 칼로리는 주의해야 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味強勁的調味料。不過，和許多食材都能搭配。但是，請格外留意熱量。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très acide, mais qui se marie pourtant bien avec une grande variété d’ingrédients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trotz der sehr säuerlichen Note passt dieses Würzmittel hervorragend zu allerlei Zutaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento que casa muy bien con muchos ingredientes a pesar de su sabor ácido.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto aspro, ma che comunque si sposa bene con una gran varietà di ingredienti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment that packs a very tart punch yet pairs well with various ingredients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味が　強い　調味料。しかし　色々な食材と　マッチする。ただし　カロリーには　注意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味强烈的调味料，然而与各种食材都很搭配，不过要注意其卡路里。",
